{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这次他在亲近里更放得开，欢喜也更充实，投入得比先前更深。前面的相处已给过他真实的安稳，所以这次他更信任眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"亲近带来的安稳，使他更敢深入地投入相处。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 9,\n      \"why\": \"前文已确立亲近本身能给他安稳，这足以解释他为何比先前更放松、更投入，不必额外假设新的心理冲突。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选3\",\n        \"候选14\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他有些羞怯，自己竟如此在意另一个人的靠近。因为他一向习惯独自安顿生活，这份亲近触到了他平日收起的需要。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他平日收起的需要，开始因真实的亲近而显出更深的分量。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"他一贯自足、习惯收起需要的经历，能支撑这种对自身依赖的羞怯感，但这比单纯的欢喜与留恋多了一层推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选12\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3ed822cb-3c91-4d26-92f0-3aa8f03a4ff2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T015823714514Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:00:04.353820+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "943954d1d06ea6d31ebf3d829e8a39e3c5819f8e59eb2302434e4121a4ff1a3a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31